  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Summit declaration that encourages progress on trade, tax and transparency, benefiting countries across the world including the poorest nations is a component of Contribution from DFID to FCO for G8 costs reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xA3;7,300,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Media and free flow of information, Financial policy and administrative management, Public finance management (PFM), Anti-corruption organisations and institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
